# Wallpapers are third-party images of unknown licence (wallhaven downloads and
# similar), and ~34 MB — the bulk of this repo's history. Keeping them out means
# the repo can be published without redistributing someone else's art. The files
# stay on disk in the working tree; they are simply not committed.
#
# NOTE: a flake only copies *git-tracked* files into the store, so anything in
# Nix that reads a path under this directory breaks once these are untracked:
#   - home/dani/wm/wallpaper.nix   sources the whole directory into
#                                  ~/Pictures/Wallpapers
#   - modules/nixos/desktop/sddm.nix  references wallhaven-jevzkp.jpg by name
# Point those at a runtime path (e.g. ~/Pictures/Wallpapers, populated by hand)
# or at a fetched derivation before dropping the tracked copies.
home/dani/assets/wallpapers/
